<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.5 Full-Shot Results With Standard Deviation ‣ Appendix A Supplementary Experiments and Results ‣ Super-Linear: A Lightweight Pretrained Mixture of Linear Experts for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> reports the standard deviation of the results presented in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Full-Shot Forecasting. ‣ A.1 Full-Shot Forecasting ‣ Appendix A Supplementary Experiments and Results ‣ Super-Linear: A Lightweight Pretrained Mixture of Linear Experts for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, calculated over three runs with different random seeds.</p>
</div>
