<section id="A1.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.6 </span>Full Ablation Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section the full results of the LTSF ablation elements from Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.3 Expert Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Super-Linear: A Lightweight Pretrained Mixture of Linear Experts for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Super-Linear full-shot comparison to Linear and MoE based models. All models utilize a lookback of 512.</figcaption>
<div id="A1.T8.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:281.9pt;height:76.5pt;vertical-align:-36.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-60.4pt,16.4pt) scale(0.7,0.7) ;">
<table id="A1.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"></th>
<th id="A1.T8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">Full Model</th>
