<td id="A6.T12.2.1.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Standard deviation of noise added to gating mechanism</td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="A6.T12.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T12.2.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Maximal Energy Loss <math id="A6.T12.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{maxloss}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{maxloss}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">The maximum allowed fraction of normalized energy loss during the resampling process</td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.17.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="A6.T12.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.2</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T12.2.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Scales <math id="A6.T12.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S=\{s_{1},s_{2},...\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S=\{s_{1},s_{2},...\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">The resampling scale factor for the interpolation of the <span id="A6.T12.2.1.18.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Long Lookback Resample Search Algorithm</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.18.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="A6.T12.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{2,4,6\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{2,4,6\}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T12.2.1.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Energy Loss Penalty Scaler <math id="A6.T12.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">A scaler to control the incurred energy loss penalty of the <span id="A6.T12.2.1.19.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Long Lookback Resample Search Algorithm</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.1.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="A6.T12.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.T13" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 13: </span>Description of hyperparameters for in-domain (FS) Super-Linear configuration.</figcaption>
<div id="A6.T13.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:102.1pt;vertical-align:-49.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-163.4pt,48.4pt) scale(0.513498109804726,0.513498109804726) ;">
<table id="A6.T13.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A6.T13.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T13.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A6.T13.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></th>
